2026/08/serum-glial-fibrillary-acidic-protein-dynamics-disease-progression-and-therapy-response-in-multiple-sclerosis</guid></item><item><title>自动语音分析可识别原发性进行性失语症的临床、解剖和病理变异</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/automated-speech-analysis-to-identify-clinical-anatomical-and-pathological-variants-of-primary-progressive-aphasia</link><description>这项横断面研究调查了连接语音的自动分析是否可以区分原发性进行性失语症变异并反映神经解剖学和神经病理学基础。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/automated-speech-analysis-to-identify-clinical-anatomical-and-pathological-variants-of-primary-progressive-aphasia2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:34:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/automated-speech-analysis-to-identify-clinical-anatomical-and-pathological-variants-of-primary-progressive-aphasia</guid></item><item><title>设计超快速充电电池的新策略可以防止危险的锂电镀</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-strategy-for-designing-ultra-fast-charging-batteries-could-prevent-hazardous-lithium-plating</link><description>重新设计的锂离子阳极在要求的 10C 充电速率下保留了 86% 的初始容量，并在超过 250 个循环中保持稳定，同时旨在减少快速充电过程中危险的锂沉积。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/new-strategy-for-designing-ultra-fast-charging-batteries-could-prevent-hazardous-lithium-plating3.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:19:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/new-strategy-for-designing-ultra-fast-charging-batteries-could-prevent-hazardous-lithium-plating</guid></item><item><title>文明超材料</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/civilizational-metamaterials</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:04:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/civilizational-metamaterials</guid></item><item><title>🏰 在人工智能中幸存的唯一护城河</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/%f0%9f%8f%b0-the-only-moat-that-survives-ai</link><description>克里斯蒂安·卡塔利尼（Christian Catalini）的核心论点是，人工智能正在将智能本身商品化，因此传统的竞争优势来源（“护城河”）变得越来越不持久。相反，稀缺资源从“生成答案”转向“验证哪些答案实际上是正确的”。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/f09f8fb0-the-only-moat-that-survives-ai2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 23:49:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/%f0%9f%8f%b0-the-only-moat-that-survives-ai</guid></item><item><title>68GaDOTATOC PET/CT 图像的纹理分析用于预测神经内分泌肿瘤患者的预后</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/texture-analysis-of-68gadotatoc-pet-ct-images-for-the-prediction-of-outcome-in-patients-with-neuroendocrine-tumors</link><description>目的：我们研究的目的是评估 68Ga-DOTATOC PET/CT 图像的纹理分析是否可以预测神经内分泌肿瘤 (NET) 患者的临床结果。方法：对 47 名接受 68Ga-DOTATOC PET/CT 的 NET 患者进行了研究。原发肿瘤位于胃肠胰（n = 35）、支气管肺（n = 8）和其他（n = 4）区域。使用自动轮廓程序对NET病灶进行分割并进行纹理分析，从而获得常规参数SUVmax和SUVmean，原发病灶的体积参数，如受体表达肿瘤体积（RETV）和总病灶受体表达（TLRE），全身病灶的体积参数，如wbRETV和wbTLRE，以及纹理特征，如变异系数（CoV）、HISTO偏度、 HISTO 峰度、HISTO 熵-log10、GLCM 熵-log10、GLCM 相异度和 NGLDM 粗糙度。患者接受了 17 个月的平均随访期，并使用 Kaplan-Meier 方法和时序检验进行生存分析。结果：分析了 47 个原发病变。进行了生存分析，包括临床变量以及常规、体积和纹理成像特征。在单变量分析中，总生存期 (OS) 通过年龄 (p = 0.0079)、分级 (p = 0.0130)、SUVmax (p = 0.0017)、SUVmean (p = 0.0011)、CoV (p = 0.0037)、HISTO Entropy-log10 (p = 0.0039)、GLCM 进行预测熵-log10 (p = 0.0044) 和 GLCM 相异性 (p = 0.0063)。在多变量分析中，模型中仅保留 GLCM Entropy-log10 (χ2 = 7.7120，p = 0.0055)。 Kaplan-Meier 曲线显示，GLCM Entropy-log10 &amp;gt;1.28 的患者的 OS 明显优于 GLCM Entropy-log10 ≤1.28 的患者（χ2 = 10.6063，p = 0.0011）。结论：68Ga-DOTATOC PET/CT图像的纹理分析，通过揭示生长抑素受体表达的异质性，可以预测NET患者的临床结果。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/texture-analysis-of-68gadotatoc-pet-ct-images-for-the-prediction-of-outcome-in-patients-with-neuroendocrine-tumors2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 23:34:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/texture-analysis-of-68gadotatoc-pet-ct-images-for-the-prediction-of-outcome-in-patients-with-neuroendocrine-tumors</guid></item><item><title>达格列净降低择期心脏手术围手术期急性肾损伤的风险</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dapagliflozin-to-reduce-the-risk-of-perioperative-acute-kidney-injury-in-elective-cardiac-surgery</link><description>该网站使用安全服务来防范恶意机器人。当网站验证您不是机器人时会显示此页面。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/dapagliflozin-to-reduce-the-risk-of-perioperative-acute-kidney-injury-in-elective-cardiac-surgery2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 23:19:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/dapagliflozin-to-reduce-the-risk-of-perioperative-acute-kidney-injury-in-elective-cardiac-surgery</guid></item><item><title>治疗获得性下丘脑肥胖</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/treating-acquired-hypothalamic-obesity</link><description>作者描述了在获得性下丘脑肥胖症患者中进行 MC4R 激动剂试验的科学依据。服用这种药物的人体重指数和饥饿感都有所下降。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/treating-acquired-hypothalamic-obesity2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 23:04:25 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/treating-acquired-hypothalamic-obesity</guid></item></channel></rss>